# Supabase — Phase 2 authentication (login / signup)
#
# 1. Create a project at https://supabase.com
# 2. Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in the two values from
#    Project Settings → API in your Supabase dashboard.
# 3. Restart `npm run dev` (Vite only reads env files at startup).
#
# The anon key is a public client key — it is safe to ship in the browser
# bundle; row-level security in Supabase is what protects your data.
# Never put the `service_role` key in a VITE_* variable.
#
# When these are unset the app runs in "unconfigured" mode: it builds and
# renders normally, and the auth features stay inert (see src/lib/supabase.ts).

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-public-key
